{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"alias":"misogynous-demonian-fly","creation_channel":"mcp","description":"## Context / Problem\nThe tests/scripts/reducer cohort contains audited comments or docstrings that obscure current behavior with repetition, obvious narration, duplicated explanation, or historical detail. The audit is pinned to `9e65567b79ffe872534c3c656ade7b34340d8192`.\n\n## Approach\nEdit explanatory text only in this directory/subsystem cohort. Condense it to current, non-obvious rationale and constraints; retain every file-specific preserve item and consumer contract below. Grouping adjacent files from one subsystem keeps the change reviewable in one session and permits one coherent verification pass without changing executable behavior.\n\n## Scope\n- `tests/scripts/reducer/test_managed_refs.py:1-12, 78-80, 137-139, 172-174, 216-221` — Preserve managed-reference monotonicity, legacy snapshot seeding, and post-compaction removal propagation. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/scripts/reducer/test_reducer_cache.py:1-6, 19-40, 77-97, 144-168, 238-259, 291-312, 344-365, 412-432` — Preserve cache invalidation dimensions and benchmark thresholds. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/scripts/reducer/test_reducer_core.py:1-6, 19-21, 60-80, 123-135, 166-179, 205-240, 272-293, 339-353, 391-407, 445-447, 502-525, 544-564, 606-608, 662-669` — Preserve ordering, fork tie-break, corrupt-only versus empty distinction, `fsck_needed`, and logging contract. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/scripts/reducer/test_reducer_exclude_session_logs.py:1-9` — Preserve default-off compatibility and exclusion semantics. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/scripts/reducer/test_reducer_fields.py:1-6, 16-18, 115-117, 146-158, 182-194, 217-231, 266-283, 315-334` — Preserve ADF coercion, embedded JSON round-trip, and falsy non-null handling. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/scripts/reducer/test_reducer_file_impact.py:1-6, 17-39, 71-75, 114-117, 149-152, 184-201` — Preserve last-write-wins and missing/null normalization. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/scripts/reducer/test_reducer_links.py:1-20, 71-73, 150-156, 397-419, 466-490, 524-528` — Preserve legacy `target`, cancellation ordering, and canonical target resolution. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/scripts/reducer/test_reducer_reduce_all.py:1-6, 19-30, 38-51, 116-129, 193-197, 209-215, 293-327, 374-387, 434-449, 503-511, 559-576` — Preserve fast-skip, orphan-marker self-heal, marker-sensitive hash, cache invalidation, and REVERT behavior. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/scripts/reducer/test_reducer_snapshot.py:1-6, 17-29, 66-77, 121-134, 183-195, 228-247, 334-356` — Preserve restore, source UUID dedup, cache invalidation, and post-snapshot replay. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/scripts/reducer/test_ticket_alias_backfill.py:1-22, 59-64, 116-123, 173-178, 331-343, 368-379, 402-407` — Preserve stored-alias authority, binding-store Jira lookup, snapshot-only resolution, and legacy/genesis separation. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/scripts/reducer/test_ticket_inbound.py:1-23, 40-42, 140-142` — Preserve inbound/children output contract and inactive-source exclusion. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/scripts/reducer/test_ticket_llm_format.py:1-6, 22-25, 39-41, 91-93, 149-151, 182-184, 215-217, 250-252` — Preserve abbreviated-key contract. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/scripts/reducer/test_ticket_reducer_conflict.py:1-14, 46-51, 71-83, 119-131, 165-167, 202-217` — Preserve first-file-wins UUID dedup and snapshot composition. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/scripts/reducer/test_ticket_reducer_edit.py:1-26, 36-38, 49-51, 97-99, 129-131, 161-163, 195-197, 233-235, 274-276` — Preserve EDIT merge/LWW contract. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/scripts/reducer/test_ticket_reducer_llm_format.py:1-23, 38-50, 56-82, 118-130, 172-187` — Preserve import/re-export and mapping/omission contracts. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/scripts/reducer/test_ticket_reducer_marker.py:1-15, 24-48, 56-79, 93-105, 117-129, 142-154, 169-181, 200-213` — Preserve marker API, idempotency, and error tolerance. Consumer: none found.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] Every listed location contains only current, non-obvious rationale or constraints after remediation; verified by reviewing the final diff against every Scope row.\n- [ ] Every preserve item and consumer contract in Scope remains explicit and accurate; verified by a row-by-row completion comment and the commands under Verification.\n- [ ] No executable behavior or test assertion changes; verified by the commands under Verification exiting 0.\n\n## Verification\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" make lint`\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" .venv/bin/python scripts/check_comment_hygiene.py`\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" pytest tests/scripts/reducer/test_managed_refs.py tests/scripts/reducer/test_reducer_cache.py tests/scripts/reducer/test_reducer_core.py tests/scripts/reducer/test_reducer_exclude_session_logs.py tests/scripts/reducer/test_reducer_fields.py tests/scripts/reducer/test_reducer_file_impact.py tests/scripts/reducer/test_reducer_links.py tests/scripts/reducer/test_reducer_reduce_all.py tests/scripts/reducer/test_reducer_snapshot.py tests/scripts/reducer/test_ticket_alias_backfill.py tests/scripts/reducer/test_ticket_inbound.py tests/scripts/reducer/test_ticket_llm_format.py tests/scripts/reducer/test_ticket_reducer_conflict.py tests/scripts/reducer/test_ticket_reducer_edit.py tests/scripts/reducer/test_ticket_reducer_llm_format.py tests/scripts/reducer/test_ticket_reducer_marker.py`\n\nThe row-by-row diff review is authoritative for prose quality; the hygiene guard detects only its narrow deterministic history-token rule.","id":"ac3c-32ef-3448-4027","parent_id":"2d43-3c39-307e-4450","priority":3,"repos":["rebar"],"tags":["comments","documentation","maintainability","grouped-remediation"],"ticket_type":"task","title":"Condense comments in tests/scripts/reducer"},"env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","event_type":"CREATE","timestamp":1788571233316476828,"uuid":"db8e89bb-60fd-4ed1-95a1-f2d5eb3e516e"}